{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":113379,\"title\":\"Gold Rush in Australia\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Two men, one mission. Andrew and Mat are old pals, and they share a great passion: the search for gold! In the Australian wilderness adventurers hoping for the big discovery. Prospectors Mat has operated there for over ten years, that is what \\\"washing dirt\\\" is called: He dredged tons of earth by a huge drum and washes out the fine gold. And Andrew is active in the outback at his side, because the German after several trips to the continent now is also an expert in Australia. On Mats mine the men live their dream of gold rush in Australia.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mGe9ZEY265Yoj8AORNo8skfflnK.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/esVsE68mLITIDpwx1WqiUQk8zvA.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2013,\"genres\":[\"Reality\",\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":7,\"totalEpisodes\":53,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"DMAX\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"DE\",\"name\":\"Germany\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-07-02\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5478162,\"name\":\"Andreas Macherey\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5478163,\"name\":\"Matthew Vaughan\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":null}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"w3en3b5CZc0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"CSF9jysFMMc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"sbrXOfWhuwE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":76506,\"title\":\"Gold Rush: White Water\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xgMyo8Re5uufo90Dxm773Tnjh1o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42934782608695654,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":71322,\"title\":\"Aussie Gold Hunters\",\"poster\":\"https://i